{"id":"n59225-1-7","stage":5,"title":"번지다 · 洇","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59225-1-7-1","ko":"젠장, 그림이 다 번졌잖아.","zh":"可恶，画都洇开了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"젠장,","meaning":"坏了，他妈的","explanation":"젠장：坏了，他妈的","readings":[{"term":"젠장","audio":"/audio/06a4097095a9d991ddc5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75229","senseId":"1","lemma":"젠장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그림이","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번졌잖아.","meaning":"洇，渗开","explanation":"번지다：洇，渗开；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"번지다","audio":"/audio/c31537b080a8588199b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59225","senseId":"1","lemma":"번지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"06a4097095a9d991","term":"젠장","zh":"坏了，他妈的","audio":"/audio/06a4097095a9d991ddc5.mp3","entryId":"75229","definition":"不合意且很不满时自言自语骂人。","pronunciation":["젠ː장"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"一点不剩或不落下而全部。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"c31537b080a85881","term":"번지다","zh":"洇，渗开","audio":"/audio/c31537b080a8588199b1.mp3","entryId":"59225","definition":"液体沾上后湿的地方渐渐扩散。","pronunciation":["번ː지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d9a5254288f61994d983.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59225-1-7-2","ko":"누가 일부러 그림에 물을 뿌린 것 같은데?","zh":"好像有人故意往画上洒水了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일부러","meaning":"故意地","explanation":"일부러：故意地","readings":[{"term":"일부러","audio":"/audio/f480026f697b4b9df412.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25159","senseId":"2","lemma":"일부러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그림에","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물을","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뿌린","meaning":"撒，散发","explanation":"뿌리다：撒，散发；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"뿌리다","audio":"/audio/9486f088d39eab79fc2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65867","senseId":"2","lemma":"뿌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁，某某，有人","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指无须透露姓名的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"f480026f697b4b9d","term":"일부러","zh":"故意地","audio":"/audio/f480026f697b4b9df412.mp3","entryId":"25159","definition":"明明知道却隐瞒自己知道或隐藏做某个行为的本意。","pronunciation":["일ː부러"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"9486f088d39eab79","term":"뿌리다","zh":"撒，散发","audio":"/audio/9486f088d39eab79fc2b.mp3","entryId":"65867","definition":"投掷或泼洒以使其分散落在各处。","pronunciation":["뿌리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/22f6a5fa7edb42067a88.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59225","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["可恶，画都洇开了。","好像有人故意往画上洒水了？","比赛结果怎么样了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["可恶，画都洇开了。","好像有人故意往画上洒水了？","比赛结果怎么样了？"],"answer":1}]}
